 On rejection, the same inspected FD supplies bounded diagnostic-only metadata: actual file length, at most32 prefix bytes as hex, decoded container magic, at most256 table bytes, at most8 slice/header records, selected index where established, and stability status. Maximum header-region reads are66080 bytes including the selected load commands. A rejected record explicitly has `fullFileHashEstablished=false`; it is never an admitted identity. File removal or stability-check failure is recorded without replacing the original parse error. Missing/unopenable files remain explicit errors rather than guessed formats.
 
 The tiny control parser, control source/commands, historical SDK46/Core836 graph, process observation/birth rules, exact UUID/path/triggered-stack admission, source/byte custody, collector budgets, SDK selection/concurrency, deadlines and supervisors are unchanged. A different architecture or a report UUID mismatch remains unattributed; this is not a generic Mach-O framework or a product crash fix. Synthetic positives and negatives exercise format parsing, full-container drift and inventory-before-rejection; no toolchain image was executed or read locally, and no hosted helper compatibility or SDK crash cause is claimed.
+
+
+Source010 scopes SWIFT_BACKTRACE to the owned `control-signal`, `focused-test` and `full-test` commands only. It removes any inherited setting from the shared command environment, preserves every other inherited/owned-path value, and restores that exact base environment in `finally` after each crash command. The existing GuardedRunner, command argv, PID/session ownership, cleanup, resource/deadline guards, strict metadata parsers, source/lock joins and test selection/concurrency are unchanged. Control compile, metadata, Git, resolve, build and discovery use the clean base environment. Existing tool lookup `env -u` remains as previously exercised.
+
+Actual source009 run35399941301 admitted the expected SIG11 control IPS report and both FAT32 tool images, then stopped before SDK resolve/build: Apple Git emitted the exact privileged-backtrace warning before the correct SDK commit/tree, so strict identity parsing rejected it. Final global acceptance remains false. `SOURCE010-CORRECTION.json` records the independently retained control evidence and precise image formats without converting that failed experiment into qualification. No warning filtering, last-line selection or parser relaxation is introduced.
